## Implementation Workflow (MANDATORY)

### Step 1: Before ANY Change
```bash
# Verify file exists
ls lib/path/to/file.dart

# Check current imports (before deleting)
grep -r "path/to/file" lib/

# Read the entire file first
```

### Step 2: Implement Change
- Follow existing patterns in file
- Use theme colors, not hardcoded
- Add `context.mounted` checks after async

### Step 3: Verify Change
```bash
# Check for errors
flutter analyze

# Test the app
flutter run
```

### Step 4: Test Manually
- [ ] Light mode works
- [ ] Dark mode works
- [ ] RTL works (if layout changed)
- [ ] No console errors

## Provider Patterns

### Reading Data (for UI):
```dart
// ✅ Use watch for reactive UI
final data = ref.watch(dataProvider);

// ✅ Use select for performance
final balance = ref.watch(accountProvider.select((a) => a.balance));
```

### Triggering Actions:
```dart
// ✅ Use read for one-time actions
ref.read(notifierProvider.notifier).doAction();

// ✅ Invalidate to refresh
ref.invalidate(dataProvider);
```

### AsyncValue Handling (ALWAYS use this pattern):
```dart
return dataAsync.when(
  loading: () => const LoadingWidget(),
  error: (error, stack) => ErrorStateWidget(
    message: error.toString(),
    onRetry: () => ref.invalidate(dataProvider),
  ),
  data: (items) {
    if (items.isEmpty) {
      return EmptyStateWidget(
        icon: Icons.inbox,
        message: 'No items yet',
        actionLabel: 'Add First',
        onAction: () => _addItem(),
      );
    }
    return ListView.builder(
      itemCount: items.length,
      itemBuilder: (context, index) => ItemCard(item: items[index]),
    );
  },
);
```

## Common Patterns

### RefreshIndicator (add to all list screens):
```dart
RefreshIndicator(
  onRefresh: () async {
    ref.invalidate(dataProvider);
    // Wait for the provider to reload
    await ref.read(dataProvider.future);
  },
  child: ListView.builder(
    physics: const AlwaysScrollableScrollPhysics(), // IMPORTANT!
    // ... rest
  ),
)
```

### Context After Async:
```dart
Future<void> _saveItem() async {
  await ref.read(notifier).save();
  
  // ✅ ALWAYS check mounted
  if (!context.mounted) return;
  
  FeedbackService.showSuccess(context, 'Saved!');
  Navigator.pop(context);
}
```

### Theme Colors (NEVER hardcode):
```dart
// ❌ BAD
color: Colors.black87
color: Colors.white

// ✅ GOOD
color: Theme.of(context).colorScheme.onSurface
color: Theme.of(context).colorScheme.surface

// ❌ BAD (hardcoded grey)
color: Colors.grey.shade300

// ✅ GOOD (dark mode aware)
color: Theme.of(context).dividerColor
```

## Performance Rules

### ListView Optimization:
```dart
ListView.builder(
  cacheExtent: 500,           // Pre-render ahead
  itemExtent: 72,             // If fixed height
  physics: const AlwaysScrollableScrollPhysics(),
  itemBuilder: (context, index) => ItemCard(
    key: ValueKey(items[index].id), // Unique key
    item: items[index],
  ),
)
```

### const Constructors:
```dart
// ✅ Use const wherever possible
const SizedBox(height: 16)
const EdgeInsets.all(16)
const Icon(Icons.add)
```

